Remove a workflow previously installed via `ags workflow add`.

Only external workflows installed under the CLI's config
directory can be removed this way. Built-in workflows
(bundled into the `ags` binary, whether Rust or YAML)
cannot be removed and produce an error naming the
workflow as built-in.

Usage:
  workflow remove <id>

Arguments:
  <id>
          Id of the installed workflow to remove

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
